1
00:00:00,031 --> 00:00:01,931
(Leonard:)Okay, I got to...
I-I just...

2
00:00:01,933 --> 00:00:04,163
I got to ask:

3
00:00:04,169 --> 00:00:06,069
(Leonard:)what makes you think
that your relationship

4
00:00:06,071 --> 00:00:08,671
(Leonard:)is so wonderful
and ours isn't?

5
00:00:08,673 --> 00:00:10,103
(Sheldon:)For starters,

6
00:00:10,108 --> 00:00:12,178
(Sheldon:)we enjoy spending time together.

7
00:00:16,281 --> 00:00:18,081
(Leonard:)So do we.

8
00:00:18,083 --> 00:00:20,013
(Leonard:)And I've seen you guys
ignore each other for hours

9
00:00:20,018 --> 00:00:22,048
(Leonard:)doing totally
different things.

10
00:00:22,053 --> 00:00:25,453
(Sheldon:)It's called parallel play.

11
00:00:25,457 --> 00:00:27,057
(Leonard:)Yeah, toddlers
do that.

12
00:00:27,058 --> 00:00:30,028
(Sheldon:)Not as well as we do.
(clicks tongue)

13
00:00:31,363 --> 00:00:33,933
(Leonard:)You believe this guy? He has to
be the best at everything.

14
00:00:33,932 --> 00:00:36,202
(Penny:)So what?
Why do you even care?

15
00:00:36,201 --> 00:00:38,031
(Sheldon:)Oh, listen to them.

16
00:00:38,036 --> 00:00:40,936
(Sheldon:)Not even married
and the honeymoon's over.

17
00:00:40,939 --> 00:00:43,609
(Leonard:)Whatever. You can't
even go on a date

18
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:45,808
(Leonard:)without checking your
relationship agreement.

19
00:00:45,811 --> 00:00:49,381
(Sheldon:)If you've got a problem basing
a relationship on a contract,

20
00:00:49,381 --> 00:00:52,751
(Sheldon:)I'd like to tell you
about 13 plucky colonies

21
00:00:52,751 --> 00:00:54,751
(Sheldon:)that entered
a "relationship agreement"

22
00:00:54,753 --> 00:00:57,383
(Sheldon:)called the U.S. Constitution.

23
00:00:57,389 --> 00:00:59,789
(Sheldon:)And it may not be cool
to say so,

24
00:00:59,791 --> 00:01:04,021
(Sheldon:)but I think that love affair
is still pretty hot today.

